'' A ustring argument to a runtime entry's narrow string parameter -- mkdir, dir, and a
'' ustring concatenation to setenviron -- is converted with fb_UStrToStr rather than
'' handed over as its own FBUSTRING. See the source.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --dump-ir tests/mir/src/ustr-runtime-narrow-arg.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-OUT: verify: ok
'' EXPECT-OUT: 0 statements not lowered
'' EXPECT-OUT: fb_UStrToStr(@root, -1)
'' EXPECT-OUT: fb_UStrToStr(@$tmp
'' EXPECT-NOT: fb_MkDir(@root)
'' EXPECT-NOT: fb_Dir(@root
'' EXPECT-NOT: fb_RmDir(@root)
'' EXPECT-NOT: fb_SetEnviron(@
